At 07:08 PM 04/17/2001 -0400, Pierre Abbat wrote:
> >It's a little compact for my taste, but it'd certainly work.  Where do
> >the definitions themselves go, though?
>
>The definition is just "animal".

But that isn't a definition!  That is just a keyword for the x1 of 
danlu.  Limiting "definitions" to keywords of x1 will encourage malrarna 
usages that do not reflect the predicate grammar.

Any proper definition of a Lojban word MUST include all the places, and 
pretty much treat those places as equals.  A keyword is useful as a 
mnemonic, or as an aid to writing an automated glosser but is not a definition.

